      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Validation is a property of the WRITE direction, not a stage that happens to be missing on read.\nDecision C: no read-side validation. The asymmetry is the shape of the trust boundary.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Validation is a property of the WRITE direction, not a stage that happens to be missing on read.\nDecision C: no read-side validation. The asymmetry is the shape of the trust boundary.",
